#: ../../reference/configuration.rst:1052
msgid ""
"``guidedog build --untrusted`` builds a project whose sources we did not "
"write. Raw content is left out, nothing is fetched, and no build plugin "
"runs. The project cannot widen what the build reads. ``include_roots`` "
"and ``pdf_preamble`` are not used. Files and folders that lead outside "
"the source folder (``html_logo``, ``html_favicon``, ``pdf_logo``, "
"``mathjax_config_path``, ``html_static_path``, ``html_extra_path``, "
"``templates_path``, ``locale_dirs``, ``pdf_font_paths``, "
"``autodoc_source_paths``, ``odin_autoapi_dirs``, ``rust_autoapi_crates``) "
"are left out. No Typst package is downloaded. Each dropped setting is a "
"``build.untrusted`` warning. This is a capability policy, not a process "
"sandbox. See :doc:`cli`."
msgstr ""

